# Intentionally empty — but do not delete.
#
# Vercel resolves .vercelignore from this project's Root Directory (api/) and
# falls back to the repository root only when this file is absent. The root
# one ignores /api/ to keep the shop deploy under the Hobby serverless-function
# cap, which would strip this project's own package.json before `npm install`.
#
# Removing this file breaks every API deploy. See docs/SPLIT_ARCHITECTURE.md.
